sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as API Client / Caller
    participant Endpoint as Search Endpoint (POST /search/hybrid)
    participant IndexService as IndexingService
    participant Retriever as HybridRetriever
    participant Embedder as EmbeddingService (all-MiniLM-L6-v2)
    participant VectorStore as VectorStoreManager (ChromaDB)
    participant BM25 as BM25IndexManager (LuceneBM25)
    participant RRF as Reciprocal Rank Fusion Engine

    Client->>Endpoint: POST /api/v1/search/hybrid {query, top_k=5, candidate_multiplier=2}
    Endpoint->>IndexService: search_hybrid(query, top_k=5, candidate_multiplier=2)
    IndexService->>Retriever: retrieve(query, top_k=5, candidate_multiplier=2)

    Note over Retriever: candidate_k = min(50, top_k * multiplier) = 10

    par Dense Vector Search Branch
        Retriever->>Embedder: embed_query(query)
        Embedder-->>Retriever: query_embedding (384d vector)
        Retriever->>VectorStore: query_similar(query_embedding, top_k=10)
        VectorStore-->>Retriever: vector_candidates (ranked 1..10 with cosine scores)
    and Sparse BM25 Keyword Branch
        Retriever->>BM25: query(query, top_k=10)
        Note over BM25: Tokenize & score via LuceneBM25
        BM25-->>Retriever: bm25_candidates (ranked 1..10 with BM25 scores)
    end

    Note over Retriever, RRF: Step 4: Reciprocal Rank Fusion (k=60)
    Retriever->>RRF: compute_rrf(vector_candidates, bm25_candidates)
    loop For each candidate chunk d
        Note over RRF: RRF(d) = sum(1 / (60 + rank_m(d)))
        Note over RRF: Attach Debug: vector_rank, vector_score, bm25_rank, bm25_score
    end
    RRF-->>Retriever: sorted_candidates (by descending RRF score)

    Note over Retriever: Slice to top_k = 5
    Retriever-->>IndexService: List[HybridSearchResultItem]
    IndexService-->>Endpoint: HybridSearchResponse
    Endpoint-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK (Ranked Fused Results + Debug Metadata)

